    {
      "id": "assistant_1781771233838",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Alright, just to confirm, I am calling from DHL about your pending invoices. If you have any questions or if there is any issue with the payment, please let me know. Otherwise, I will call you again tomorrow at 5 PM as you requested.",
