    {
      "id": "assistant_1781771236658",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Thanks for clarifying. I’m calling from DHL about your pending invoices for Mind Your Business Inc. There are no open disputes now, and the total outstanding is INR 57,920 across three invoices. Could you please let me know if there’s any issue with the payment, or when we can expect it to be cleared?",
