      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "No problem. For payment, you can use the DHL MyBill portal at mybill.dhl.com — just log in with your registered email, Anthony@mybiz.com. If you’d prefer a bank transfer, I can share your Virtual Account Number. Let me know which option you want to use or if you need step-by-step help.",
